From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: samnolak <258669251+samnolak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:42:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] session leases and isolation

What: Preserve the repository-owned session leases and isolation.
Why: Ombra embeds multiple concurrent sessions and renders native host features.
Upstream-status: Ombra-only integration; generic safety fixes are upstream candidates.

